Licensing of this repository

Fonts and their license files under src/galley_pdf_fonts/data/<family>/ are
not covered by this file: each font is under its own license, whose text from
the font release lies in the same directory and is named in the license field
of its entry in src/galley_pdf_fonts/data/fonts.toml (OFL-1.1, Bitstream Vera
and Arev licenses with public domain changes, GUST Font License).

The code of this repository - src/galley_pdf_fonts/__init__.py, scripts/,
tests/, pyproject.toml, fonts.toml and README.md - is under the same terms as
the galley repository: copyright the galley authors, all rights reserved; no
license is granted yet.
